[36mIf the "hash" values do not include at least the following FIPS 140-2/140-3 compliant algorithms "SHA2-256 SHA2-384 SHA2-512 SHA2-224 SHA3-256 SHA3-384 SHA3-512 SHAKE-256", this is a finding.[39m

[36mIf there are algorithms that include "SHA1" or a hash value less than "256" this is a finding.[39m

[36mIf the "min_rsa_size" is not set to a value of at least 2048, this is a finding.[39m
[36m [39m
[36mIf these commands do not return any output, this is a finding.[39m

[36m```[39m
